Package: oob3sum
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: BLAKE3 HASHER
 Blistering BLAKE3 tree hasher achieving multi-gigabyte per second throughput.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 tree hashing verification, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
